<section class="card mt16"><div class="card-head"><h2><%= card.account.name %></h2><span class="chip">每月 <%= card.profile.bill_day %> 日出账</span></div><div class="stats stats-3"><div><span class="muted">当前负债</span><p class="amount"><%= helpers.money(card.outstanding_cents) %></p></div><div><span class="muted">溢缴款</span><p class="amount"><%= helpers.money(card.overpaid_cents) %></p></div><div><span class="muted">可抵扣的预还款</span><p class="amount"><%= helpers.money(card.unallocated_cents) %></p></div></div><p class="help">负债来自消费等真实资金流水；账单校正仅用于与银行核对，不会凭空生成消费或还款。</p></section>
<div class="finance-detail"><div><section class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>账期与账单</h2><% if(canWrite(ledger.role)){ %><form method="post" action="/finance/cards/<%= card.account.id %>/refresh"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button class="btn btn-sm">重新归集</button></form><% } %></div><% card.statements.forEach(s=>{ %><a class="finance-item" href="/finance/statements/<%= s.id %>"><div><b><%= s.closing_date %> 账单</b><p class="tiny muted">还款日 <%= s.due_date %> · <%= s.dirty?'有差异，待核对':s.confirmed_at?'银行已校正 · 版本 '+s.revision:'自动账单' %></p></div><div class="right"><b class="amount"><%= helpers.money(s.remaining_cents) %></b><p class="tiny muted">待还 · 总额 <%= helpers.money(s.total_cents) %></p></div></a><% }); %></section>
<section class="card"><h2>还款记录</h2><% if(!card.payments.length){ %><div class="empty">暂无还款。银行实际扣款后再记录。</div><% } %><% card.payments.forEach(p=>{ %><a class="finance-item" href="/finance/payments/<%= p.id %>"><div><b><%= p.txn_date %></b><p class="tiny muted"><%= p.deleted_at?'已撤销':'预还款 '+helpers.money(p.unallocated_cents) %></p></div><b class="amount"><%= helpers.money(p.amount_cents) %></b></a><% }); %></section>
<section class="card"><h2>消费分期</h2><p class="help">在账单详情中为具体消费设置分期。本金只分配一次；预计利息和费用不提前计支出。</p><% card.plans.forEach(p=>{ %><div class="finance-item"><div><b>消费 #<%= p.transaction_id %> · <%= p.term_n %> 期</b><p class="small muted">本金 <%= helpers.money(p.principal_cents) %> · 预计费用 <%= helpers.money(p.interest_cents+p.fee_cents) %> · <%= p.deleted_at?'已取消':'生效中' %></p></div><% if(!p.deleted_at&&canWrite(ledger.role)){ %><form method="post" action="/finance/plans/<%= p.id %>/cancel"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button class="btn btn-sm">取消分期</button></form><% } %></div><% }); %></section></div>
<aside><% if(canWrite(ledger.role)){ %><section class="card"><h2>信用卡还款</h2><%- include('partials/finance-payment-form',{kind:'card',targetId:card.account.id}) %></section><section class="card"><details><summary>账期与提醒设置</summary><form class="finance-form mt16" method="post" action="/finance/cards/<%= card.account.id %>/configure"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><%- include('partials/finance-card-config',{profile:card.profile}) %><button class="btn">保存设置</button></form></details></section><% } %></aside></div>
